WEBVTT

00:01.400 --> 00:03.360
Kia ora, and welcome from the team

00:03.360 --> 00:05.480
at Sela Civil Advisory.

00:05.480 --> 00:06.919
We're glad to have you on the

00:06.919 --> 00:10.027
ASHTAS Operative course.

00:10.507 --> 00:11.707
Work through the online course at

00:11.707 --> 00:14.027
your own pace. It has 56 slides

00:14.027 --> 00:15.707
with narration. Once you complete

00:15.707 --> 00:17.027
the online course, a booking

00:17.027 --> 00:18.347
button will appear at the end to

00:18.347 --> 00:20.054
book time and assessment with me.

00:20.574 --> 00:22.254
Download now your workbook using

00:22.254 --> 00:23.814
the button. You can use this

00:23.814 --> 00:25.014
throughout the course and your

00:25.014 --> 00:26.774
assessment. Please let me know if

00:26.774 --> 00:30.081
you have any questions or issues.
